  'DSC_6309-Enhanced-NR.jpg': { title: "Lancia Stratos #10, Chardonnet Livery, Retrostock", caption: "The iconic Lancia Stratos in its blue and yellow Chardonnet livery, carrying number 10 at Retrostock. This classic rally legend looked right at home on the tarmac." },
